<heading>delete - Delete an empty category.</heading>

<rule/>

<heading level="2">
Usage
</heading>

<pre>
  delete CATEGORY
</pre>

<heading level="2">
Description
</heading>

<paragraph>
Deletes a category. CATEGORY may be an id or a category name.
Only empty categories can be deleted — a category that still
contains topics is rejected.
</paragraph>

<heading level="2">
Examples
</heading>

<pre>
delete Geschichte
  Delete the category Geschichte.
</pre>

<heading level="2">
See also
</heading>

<paragraph>
add, edit, list, find
</paragraph>
